    "DixonReconstruct[real, imag, echo] reconstruxt Dixon data with initital \
guess b0 = 0 and T2star = 0.\nDixonReconstruct[real, imag, echo, b0] \
reconstructs Dixon data with intitial guess T2star = 0.\n\
DixonReconstruct[real, imag, echo, b0, t2] reconstructs Dixon data.\n\nreal \
is the real data in radials.\nimag is the imaginary data in radians.\nB0 can \
be estimated from two phase images using Unwrap.\nT2 can be estimated from \
multiple echos using T2fit.\n\nOutput is \
{{watF,fatF},{watSig,fatSig},{inphase,outphase},{B0,T2star},itterations}.\n\n\
The fractions are between 0 and 1, the B0 field map is in Hz and the T2start \
map is in ms.\n\nDixonReconstruct[] is based on DOI: 10.1002/mrm.20624 and \
10.1002/mrm.21737 (10.1002/nbm.3766).", "Documentation" -> None, "OwnValues" -> 
    None, "UpValues" -> None, "DownValues" -> None, "SubValues" -> None, 
    "DefaultValues" -> 
    Information`InformationValueForm[
     DefaultValues, QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonReconstruct, {
      SyntaxInformation[QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonReconstruct] -> {
        "ArgumentsPattern" -> {
           Blank[], 
           Blank[], 
           Blank[], 
           Optional[
            Blank[]], 
           Optional[
            Blank[]], 
           OptionsPattern[]}}}], "NValues" -> None, "FormatValues" -> None, 
    "Options" -> {
     QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonPrecessions -> -1, 
      QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonFieldStrength -> 3, 
      QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonNucleus -> "1H", 
      QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonFrequencies -> {{0}, {3.8, 3.4, 3.13, 2.67, 
        2.46, 1.92, 0.57, -0.6}}, 
      QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonAmplitudes -> {{1}, {0.089, 0.598, 0.047, 
        0.077, 0.052, 0.011, 0.035, 0.066}}, 
      QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonIterations -> 15, 
      QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonTollerance -> 0.001, 
      QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonMaskThreshhold -> 0.01, 
      QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonFilterInput -> False, 
      QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonFilterOutput -> True, 
      QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonFilterDimensions -> "3D", 
      QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonFilterSize -> 0.5, 
      QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonBipolar -> False}, 
    "Attributes" -> {Protected, ReadProtected}, "FullName" -> 
    "QMRITools`DixonTools`DixonReconstruct"|>, True]]], "Print",
